# Week 3 — Transformers and Modern NLP

## Overview
This week introduces transformer architectures and modern NLP workflows.  
The focus is on using pretrained models and libraries like Hugging Face Transformers.

---

## Concepts Covered
- Transformer architecture (Q, K, V, Self-Attention)
- Difference between:
  - BERT
  - GPT
  - Encoder-Decoder models
- Tokenization techniques:
  - WordPiece
  - BPE
  - SentencePiece

---

## Coding Tasks Implemented

### 1. Fine-Tuning BERT for Text Classification
- Loaded pretrained BERT model
- Added classification head
- Fine-tuned on IMDb sentiment dataset

### 2. Custom SentencePiece Tokenizer
- Trained a domain-specific tokenizer
- Used BPE-based SentencePiece model

### 3. Inference Using Transformers
- Sentiment analysis using Hugging Face pipeline

